# --- One clock for the whole evaluation

=== read twice
@clock 1704067200123456789
[Temporal.Now.instant().equals(Temporal.Now.instant()), Temporal.Now.plainDateTimeISO().equals(Temporal.Now.plainDateTimeISO()), Temporal.Now.instant().epochNanoseconds === Temporal.Now.instant().epochNanoseconds]
--- value
[true,true,true]

=== read in a loop
@clock -1500001
[1, 2, 3, 4].map(() => Temporal.Now.instant().epochNanoseconds)
--- value
[-1500001n,-1500001n,-1500001n,-1500001n]

=== read in a loop, each the same
@clock 1704067200123456789
[1, 2, 3, 4].map(() => Temporal.Now.plainTimeISO()).every((t, i, all) => t.equals(all[0]))
--- value
true

